WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.004 --> 00:00:19.374
Ally tossed and turned all night long, convinced that Dr.

2
00:00:19.414 --> 00:00:20.455
Lloyd knew her secret.

3
00:00:20.915 --> 00:00:25.178
Even worse, he was going to reveal it to the whole world tomorrow at the sci-fi convention.

4
00:00:25.778 --> 00:00:36.524
Everyone would soon know that she was an alien from Astralia.

5
00:00:36.544 --> 00:00:41.548
"There is a 5 percent possibility that the billboard is not referring to you," the computer announced the

6
00:00:41.588 --> 00:00:42.108
next morning.

7
00:00:42.128 --> 00:00:43.849
"But Dr.

8
00:00:43.909 --> 00:00:46.671
Lloyd invited me to be his special guest!"

9
00:00:47.111 --> 00:00:47.612
Ally said.

10
00:00:47.632 --> 00:00:50.213
"Of course the billboard refers to me."

11
00:00:50.233 --> 00:00:56.017
"In that case, it would be illogical for you to go to the museum today."

12
00:00:56.037 --> 00:01:00.840
"But if I don't go, I'll never get the stuff we need!"

13
00:01:01.341 --> 00:01:02.121
Ally wailed.

14
00:01:02.141 --> 00:01:07.140
"In that case, it would be illogical for you not to go," Alpha said.

15
00:01:07.160 --> 00:01:09.721
"Ugh!" Ally said.

16
00:01:09.741 --> 00:01:10.961
"You're right.

17
00:01:11.281 --> 00:01:12.182
I have no choice."

18
00:01:13.742 --> 00:01:16.383
She put on her meld medallion and changed to her human form.

19
00:01:17.763 --> 00:01:20.564
"Here I go," she said as she headed for the door.

20
00:01:20.584 --> 00:01:22.104
"I'll see you later."

21
00:01:22.804 --> 00:01:24.665
The computer blinked but stayed silent.

22
00:01:25.245 --> 00:01:27.746
For once Alpha didn't seem to have anything to say.

23
00:01:31.027 --> 00:01:32.687
Ally was meeting the others at the diner.

24
00:01:33.887 --> 00:01:37.840
When she arrived, Flo was waiting on tables, and Ray was cooking in the kitchen.

25
00:01:38.381 --> 00:01:39.981
The tables were filled with customers.

26
00:01:40.521 --> 00:01:42.482
Almost everyone was wearing an alien costume.

27
00:01:49.624 --> 00:01:51.024
you guys look terrific!"

28
00:01:51.644 --> 00:01:58.026
Ally said as Mateo and Bethany entered, wearing costumes too—the red uniforms of crew members from Cosmic Quest,

29
00:01:58.306 --> 00:01:59.406
a popular TV show.

30
00:01:59.426 --> 00:02:02.667
"Thanks!" Bethany said.

31
00:02:02.687 --> 00:02:04.908
"Is Kate here yet?

32
00:02:05.668 --> 00:02:08.310
She said she has a big surprise for us."

33
00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:10.051
"A surprise?"

34
00:02:11.611 --> 00:02:12.332
Ally gasped.

35
00:02:12.352 --> 00:02:16.794
"I forgot to tell Ray about the date that Kate and I arranged!"

36
00:02:17.354 --> 00:02:19.916
She turned to run into Ray's office, but it was too late.

37
00:02:20.316 --> 00:02:24.078
Kate and a woman wearing a fancy dress and high heels were walking into the diner.

38
00:02:24.098 --> 00:02:28.000
"Hello," the woman said.

39
00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:30.261
"I'm Kate's aunt Destiny.

40
00:02:30.602 --> 00:02:31.702
I'm here to see Ray."

41
00:02:32.843 --> 00:02:33.643
Mateo grinned.

42
00:02:34.924 --> 00:02:36.385
"Papi, you have a visitor!"

43
00:02:40.308 --> 00:02:41.569
Ray came into the dining room.

44
00:02:41.589 --> 00:02:43.471
"Can I help you?"

45
00:02:43.891 --> 00:02:47.754
he asked, wiping his hands on his apron, which was splattered with food stains.

46
00:02:48.435 --> 00:02:50.857
Aunt Destiny took one look at Ray and scowled.

47
00:02:50.877 --> 00:02:57.322
"I came all the way across town to meet him," she whispered loudly to Kate.

48
00:02:57.342 --> 00:02:59.284
"But he didn't even bother to wash up!

49
00:03:00.324 --> 00:03:01.846
Sorry, Kate, but I'm leaving!"

50
00:03:02.866 --> 00:03:04.508
Aunt Destiny marched out of the diner.

51
00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:11.600
Ray shook his head.

52
00:03:11.620 --> 00:03:16.922
"I have no idea what just happened, but I'm too busy for this crazy stuff," he said, heading

53
00:03:16.962 --> 00:03:17.722
back to the kitchen.

54
00:03:23.724 --> 00:03:25.384
Mateo looked from Ally to Kate.

55
00:03:25.404 --> 00:03:27.605
"What was that all about?"

56
00:03:27.625 --> 00:03:33.167
"That was all about making a mess of things," Kate mumbled.

57
00:03:33.187 --> 00:03:36.788
"It's my fault," Ally moaned.

58
00:03:38.025 --> 00:03:42.008
"I forgot to tell Ray that Kate and I invited her aunt here to meet him!"

59
00:03:42.508 --> 00:03:43.469
Flo overheard them.

60
00:03:43.489 --> 00:03:46.051
"Don't worry about it, girls.

61
00:03:46.992 --> 00:03:50.675
I'll cheer him up later with a few jokes I heard on TV last night."

62
00:03:50.695 --> 00:03:54.919
"Thanks for trying," Mateo said to Ally.

63
00:03:54.939 --> 00:03:57.861
"And Papi did enjoy playing golf yesterday."

64
00:03:57.881 --> 00:03:59.743
"That's good."

65
00:04:01.284 --> 00:04:01.904
Ally sighed.

66
00:04:01.924 --> 00:04:04.987
"Uh-oh! Look at the time!"

67
00:04:05.447 --> 00:04:06.108
Bethany said.

68
00:04:06.816 --> 00:04:08.317
"We have to get to the convention.

69
00:04:08.717 --> 00:04:10.278
Where's your costume, Ally?"

70
00:04:10.298 --> 00:04:12.319
"I have our costumes!"

71
00:04:12.980 --> 00:04:16.482
Kate pulled two pairs of pointy ears and antennae out of a bag.

72
00:04:16.502 --> 00:04:17.862
"We got them yesterday.

73
00:04:18.383 --> 00:04:22.805
And if anyone asks what we are, we're going to say we're cute aliens!"

74
00:04:27.228 --> 00:04:31.690
When Ally and her friends arrived at the museum, Phil quickly spotted them and waved them over.

75
00:04:33.471 --> 00:04:34.672
He let them in through a side door.

76
00:04:40.596 --> 00:04:43.077
"That was so nice of Phil," Mateo said.

77
00:04:43.097 --> 00:04:45.657
"He saved us a lot of time waiting in line.

78
00:04:47.518 --> 00:04:49.158
So where should we go first?"

79
00:04:50.319 --> 00:04:53.060
"I want to ride the space rocket simulator.

80
00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:57.901
I hear it makes you feel like you're flying in space," Bethany said.

81
00:04:57.921 --> 00:05:01.422
"Me too," Mateo and Kate agreed.

82
00:05:02.142 --> 00:05:04.103
Ally had no idea what they were talking about.

83
00:05:04.543 --> 00:05:05.783
But she had other things to do.

84
00:05:05.803 --> 00:05:08.684
"I, uh, don't like rides.

85
00:05:09.472 --> 00:05:10.713
I'll meet up with you guys later.

86
00:05:11.093 --> 00:05:11.614
Have fun!"

87
00:05:12.274 --> 00:05:14.175
She hurried off before they could say anything more.

88
00:05:14.195 --> 00:05:16.617
"That was easy!"

89
00:05:16.997 --> 00:05:17.518
Ally thought.

90
00:05:17.538 --> 00:05:20.340
"I hope getting my parts is just as easy."

91
00:05:21.220 --> 00:05:22.621
But when Ally arrived at Dr.

92
00:05:22.661 --> 00:05:26.644
Lloyd's exhibit hall, she realized that this task would be anything but easy.

93
00:05:27.204 --> 00:05:29.846
A guard stood at the metal detector at the entrance to the hall.

94
00:05:29.866 --> 00:05:33.389
"I can't go through that metal detector!"

95
00:05:33.789 --> 00:05:34.309
Ally thought.

96
00:05:34.329 --> 00:05:37.592
"The guard will make me take off my meld medallion.

97
00:05:38.535 --> 00:05:40.302
Ugh! What am I going to do now?"
